# Water Wings: "Until end of turn, target creature you control has base power and toughness 4/4 and gains flying and hexproof." (CR 611.2a,
# 613.4b, 702.9, 702.11) Walking Ballista (X = 1) is a 0/0 with one +1/+1 counter, a 1/1: the base 4/4 comes before the counter (CR 613.4b,
# 613.4c), so it is a 5/5 with flying and hexproof until end of turn. On turn 3 it is a 1/1 again.

